      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "Maps every field the site sends. lead_id is the join key for the LeadEvents tab — keep it column A. event_id, fbp, fbc, client_ip_address and client_user_agent are the Meta CAPI match signals; they are useless unless Normalize Fields passes them through. onError: continueRegularOutput — a Sheets failure is silent because the lead is already in Netlify Forms and the confirmation email has already been sent. Campaign/adset/ad columns and current_stage arrive in Phases 2 and 3."
